{"id":"332bc4fce3564b85","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-choice-function.md","title":"Choice Function","display":"df-choice-function — Choice Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-choice-function","aliases":["58-df-choice-function","Choice Function","58-df-zfc-choice-function"],"display":"df-choice-function — Choice Function","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-choice-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-choice-function</span><span>Choice Function</span><span>58-df-zfc-choice-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-choice-function — Choice Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal C,\\bigcup\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land f(A)\\in A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal C,\\bigcup\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land f(A)\\in A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Choice function: picks element from each set in collection</li>\n<li>AC: existence of choice function for arbitrary collections of nonempty sets</li>\n<li>Equivalents: well-ordering theorem, Zorn's lemma, Hausdorff maximality principle</li>\n<li>Countable choice (CC): enough for most analysis; stronger variants for specific needs</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Jech, The Axiom of Choice</li>\n<li>Herrlich, Axiom of Choice</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}choice\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\mathcal C,\\bigcup\\mathcal C)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal C\\;(A\\neq\\varnothing\\land f(A)\\in A)","display":true}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"359a24d272ff7fc3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ and $\\mathrm{Injective}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-choice-function]] and [[58-df-injective]])"},{"id":"fc0b9805bbc9e410","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-choice-function]]) and $\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V$ (see [[58-df-function]])"},{"id":"06a181a549196b34","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S$ (choice-function predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])"},{"id":"fd0d531fb2f84c11","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ChoiceFunction}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])"},{"id":"5f4292020626280b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F$ (class relation in conservative class notation; its restriction to any set is a choice relation, see [[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-274","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-choice-function.md|58-df-choice-function]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}